                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts536" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts537">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we go around in the community and get paper up so when the city workers come out here they don’t have to do too much because we’re going to do it</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
